1360
01:54:55,125 --> 01:54:58,083
Wally entra y planta droga.
Luego, incautan la casa.

1361
01:54:59,000 --> 01:55:01,291
Para que White Fish las compre.

1362
01:55:04,500 --> 01:55:06,500
