No, señor.

1411
01:59:28,958 --> 01:59:30,041
Hola, Allen.

1412
01:59:32,250 --> 01:59:33,583
Vinimos solos.

1413
01:59:34,791 --> 01:59:36,083
Solo queremos hablar.

1414
01:59:38,541 --> 01:59:39,458
Pasa, Tom.

1415
01:59:45,375 --> 01:59:46,583
¿Quieren café?

1416
01:59:47,666 --> 01:59:49,041
No, estoy bien.

1417
01:59:50,375 --> 01:59:51,208
¿Tom?

1418
01:59:52,250 --> 01:59:53,458
No, gracias.

1419
02:00:04,250 --> 02:00:07,083
