1431
02:01:02,875 --> 02:01:05,208
Corre, lárgate de aquí.

1432
02:01:13,500 --> 02:01:14,708
Ya sabe.

1433
02:01:17,250 --> 02:01:18,083
Se acabó.

1434
02:01:34,041 --> 02:01:35,375
Tom…

1435
02:01:36,125 --> 02:01:37,958
Bájala ya, soy yo.

1436
02:01:38,041 --> 02:01:39,416
Bájala ya.

1437
02:01:40,708 --> 02:01:43,000
Señor, no lo haga.

1438
02:01:43,083 --> 02:01:45,041
Tom, bájala ya.

1439
02:01:46,583 --> 02:01:47,500
No.

1440
02:02:49,958 --> 02:02:51,458
